  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up with our ACU Digital Camo Combat Uniform Shirt. Featuring the Army Combat Uniform (ACU) digital camo pattern and near-military specifications, these uniform shirts are great for active-duty personnel, camo enthusiasts, and more. The resilient cotton / polyester rip-stop fabric allows the combat shirt to withstand training sessions and various outdoor conditions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6004",
  "description": "<p>Gear up with our ACU Digital Camo Combat Uniform Shirt. Featuring the Army Combat Uniform (ACU) digital camo pattern and near-military specifications, these uniform shirts are great for active-duty personnel, camo enthusiasts, and more. The resilient cotton / polyester rip-stop fabric allows the combat shirt to withstand training sessions and various outdoor conditions. High-Capacity Storage: The camouflage miliary shirt comes equipped with 2 front chest pockets, 2 shoulder pockets (pen pocket on left sleeve), and elbow pad pouches (pads sold separately) for storing field gear and essentials. Customization Options: In addition to the 2 hook &amp; loop fields on the shoulders, the long sleeve combat shirt features a name tape holder on the right chest, military branch tape holder on the left chest, and rank insignia holder in the center chest. Utility at the Forefront: The ACU camo shirt features a mandarin collar, which helps protect your neck from chafing, especially when wearing body armor. The front zipper with flap closure offers additional coverage, while the adjustable wrist cuffs offer the perfect fit. All Things Camo: Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over six decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and military personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
